FA-Kara itself drew on yohane (https://github.com/Japan7/yohane) and Forced-Alignment-For-NicoKara
(https://github.com/oHEILIo/Forced-Alignment-For-NicoKara).

Third-party models and data used at runtime (not distributed with this repository):
- omniASR CTC 300M v2, Meta (Apache-2.0): initial acoustic encoder weights.
- MuQ-large-msd-iter, Tencent AI Lab (model weights CC BY-NC 4.0): frozen music-feature encoder.
  Models that include the MuQ fusion branch inherit its non-commercial condition.
- fastText lid.176 (CC BY-SA 3.0): language identification.
- JMdict furigana segmentation and KANJIDIC2, EDRDG (CC BY-SA 4.0): Japanese readings.
- CMU Pronouncing Dictionary (BSD-style), via NLTK.
- espeak-ng (GPL-3.0) through phonemizer (GPL-3.0): English, German and French pronunciations.
